This repository contains a clean, reduced PyTorch implementation derived from
architectural details and portions of the Apache-2.0-licensed Hugging Face
Transformers Mistral implementation.

Upstream source:
  huggingface/transformers
  tag: v4.45.2
  src/transformers/models/mistral/modeling_mistral.py
  src/transformers/models/mistral/configuration_mistral.py

